feat: initial DeltaForce Acc Management MVP

- Next.js 14 App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind + dnd-kit
- Supabase: 3 tables (accounts, account_milestones, holder_sessions)
- FSM: kho → dang_cay → done → da_giao_cho_ben_thu → da_nhan_tien
- Protected columns: BEFORE UPDATE trigger enforces RPC-only writes
- Finance: Decimal.js splits, no floating-point arithmetic
- Storage: bucket account-results private, signed URLs TTL 5 min
- Edge Function: batched image expiry, never deletes DB rows
- Tests: Vitest for finance and board column derivation
